abilities, can your combo-building keep pace? Only true gamblers dare challenge \u200b<strong>\u200bHell Mode\u200b</strong>\u200b, where failure means \u200b<strong>\u200bpermadeath\u200b</strong>\u200b, and victory... crowns you a \u200b<strong>\u200bWasteland Legend\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032120/extras/a775459e17aaaf12ff1aeed7a275d9d3.avif?t=1759055997\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Doomsayer"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2943030","name":"Lucky Shelter"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032120/5314f3911e308d4a108f9a2b548c4a1a71a33214/header.jpg?t=1759055997","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4032120/272566310/23119051e9937e5726b052b3c58149e7c31f28b5/1758208156/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758776055","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4032120/272566310/23119051e9937e5726b052b3c58149e7c31f28b5/1758208156/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758776055","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4032120/272566310/23119051e9937e5726b052b3c58149e7c31f28b5/1758208156/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758776055","id":257201307,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257201307/movie480.mp4?t=1758776055","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257201307/movie_max.mp4?t=1758776055"},"name":"Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257201307/b8eaf6beb1edd0380e1a1606af610f720af7e0aa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758776055","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257201307/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758776055","max":"https://